.safetensors)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── flux1-dev-kontext_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── ae.safetensor\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       ├── clip_l.safetensors\n│       └── t5xxl_fp16.safetensors 或者 t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\n```\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用须知", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [739.7614135742188, 930.9088134765625], "pos": [-1331.8948974609375, 2923.04443359375], "id": 330, "properties": {}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["Place the necklace from the right image around the woman's neck in the left image. Ensure the necklace fits naturally on her neck with accurate lighting, reflections, and shadows. Maintain the woman's original details, posture, and the overall consistent atmosphere of the scene. high quality, ultra detailed, realistic lighting"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 498, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [460.4732666015625, 119.69706726074219], "pos": [-3202.240478515625, 3732.406494140625], "id": 321, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "71c7865d2d3c934ccb99f24171e08ae5a81148ac", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 16}], "extra": {"ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "groupNodes": {}, "node_versions": {"comfy-core": "0.3.24"}, "ds": {"offset": [3675.815396910014, -2208.5847354956613], "scale": 0.6588450000000011}}, "groups": [{"color": "#88A", "font_size": 100, "flags": {}, "id": 26, "title": "学习资料", "bounding": [-1353.16259765625, 2514.62451171875, 783.8956909179688, 1358.3033447265625]}, {"color": "#88A", "font_size": 100, "flags": {}, "id": 28, "title": "Na